msgctxt "44\t279"
msgid ""
"So Toma and Mine are pushing the Okinawa resort,\\n"
"while you and the CIA try to corner Black Monday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "294\t399"
msgid "It's all starting to make sense now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "681\t781"
msgid "...I need you to stop Joji."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "782\t920"
msgid ""
"Stop him?\\n"
"You're asking us to interrupt a CIA mission?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "921\t1047"
msgid "Correct, if that's what it takes to protect Toma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1081\t1192"
msgid ""
"...Why's the CIA so keen on getting\\n"
"rid of him in the first place, though?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1193\t1278"
msgid "He knows too much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1337\t1605"
msgid ""
"He's aware of my ties to the CIA,\\n"
"and the fact that my military bill is a fake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1610\t1730"
msgid "So the CIA are gonna shut him up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1721\t1781"
msgid "Indeed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1832\t1920"
msgid "But I have no desire to see Toma killed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1934\t2047"
msgid "I want to save both him and Joji."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2057\t2188"
msgid "Hold on. Didn't Toma muck up your plans?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2189\t2268"
msgid "Why save a guy who's standing against you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2281\t2465"
msgid ""
"A man with strong enough convictions\\n"
"will inevitably hold great ambition."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2474\t2562"
msgid "And, someday, make that ambition reality."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2579\t2676"
msgid "That's what my mentor always told me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2725\t2809"
msgid "Toma has a good heart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2837\t2928"
msgid "He'll be an extraordinary politician before long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2944\t3016"
msgid "That's your reason?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3018\t3108"
msgid "It's more than that, Date-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3180\t3379"
msgid ""
"If I had to guess, I'd say Tamiya's not\\n"
"the kind of guy who'd just abandon one of his men."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3380\t3465"
msgid "It would go against everything he stands for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3502\t3562"
msgid "I'm right, aren't I?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3636\t3696"
msgid "Okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3697\t3819"
msgid ""
"By stopping Toma now,\\n"
"I'll put an end to the resort, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3840\t4002"
msgid ""
"And besides. Kazama-san's brother and I\\n"
"have some unfinished business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4028\t4068"
msgid "So you'll do it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4109\t4168"
msgid "Not because you asked me to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4169\t4310"
msgid "All I want... is to protect Morning Glory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4367\t4424"
msgid "Fair enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4425\t4707"
msgid ""
"If you keep Toma safe from Joji, I'll ensure\\n"
"that resort never sees the light of day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4711\t4762"
msgid "I swear it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4773\t4848"
msgid "And Toma? Where is he now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4885\t5059"
msgid ""
"In Okinawa. Meeting with the Prefectural\\n"
"Assembly, if my sources are correct."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5219\t5374"
msgid ""
"I thought yakuza like you only\\n"
"existed in stories these days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5419\t5510"
msgid "...It seems we have visitors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5546\t5606"
msgid "Something going on out there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5664\t5723"
msgid "Suzuki's \"security.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5724\t5777"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5778\t5874"
msgid "Toma must have planned this from the get-go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5881\t5953"
msgid "Well, Kiryu?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5959\t6032"
msgid "We don't have much choice..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6039\t6099"
msgid "Do we?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6108\t6197"
msgid ""
"That's right.\\n"
"There's only one route out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6215\t6361"
msgid ""
"And these security guys...\\n"
"What should I do with them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6374\t6533"
msgid ""
"They're essentially Suzuki's personal soldiers.\\n"
"Do whatever it takes to get through."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6551\t6631"
msgid "I'll assume the responsibility."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6697\t6764"
msgid "One more thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6765\t6800"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6801\t6904"
msgid "You said earlier that you're not interested..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6905\t7057"
msgid ""
"But doesn't every politician dream\\n"
"of becoming prime minister someday?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7069\t7150"
msgid "Then allow me to flip the script, if you will."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7151\t7284"
msgid ""
"Can a footsoldier become chairman\\n"
"just by saying they want to?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7306\t7536"
msgid ""
"Those who reach the top are lifted there\\n"
"by their actions, whether they will it or not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7550\t7610"
msgid "Am I wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7666\t7726"
msgid "Guess you have a point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7783\t7844"
msgid "Well all right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7853\t7894"
msgid "We gotta move."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7895\t7955"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8183\t8273"
msgid "Hot damn. That's a lot of guys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8274\t8428"
msgid ""
"Date-san. I'll mop up here.\\n"
"You go sneak out the back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8429\t8465"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8466\t8517"
msgid "You're media, remember?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8518\t8600"
msgid ""
"Just show them your business card.\\n"
"They should let you through no problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8601\t8648"
msgid "But then!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8649\t8712"
msgid "If I don't come back..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8713\t8829"
msgid "Tell Majima-san everything we just heard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8830\t8876"
msgid "Kiryu..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8877\t8937"
msgid "Now go!"
msgstr ""